{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22497","headline":"浩歌行 · 白居易","name":"浩歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天长地久无终毕，昨夜今朝又明日。\n鬓发苍浪牙齿疎，不觉身年四十七。\n前去五十有几年，把镜照面心茫然。\n既无长绳系白日，又无大药驻朱颜。\n朱颜日渐不如故，青史功名在何处？\n欲留年少待富贵，富贵不来年少去。\n去复去兮如长河，东流赴海无回波。\n贤愚贵贱同归尽，北邙冢墓高嵯峨。\n古来如此非独我，未死有酒且高歌。\n颜回短命伯夷饿，我今所得亦已多。\n功名富贵须待命，命若不来知奈何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22497.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22497","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}